"<section id="conclusion" class="slide slide-title" data-kind="title" data-line="1">
<h1 class="headline">Conclusion</h1>
<aside class="notes" data-source="generated">
<ol>
<li>Explore further the notion of AI as a "professional dilettante" -- considerable knowledge beyond human capacity, yet without common sense. The perfect match for an <em>enthusiastic dilettante</em> ... <a href="https://youtu.be/VPuoeQmU6C4">what could possibly go wrong</a>??</li>
