"<section id="the-spec-stack" class="slide slide-title" data-kind="title" data-line="1">
<h1 class="headline">"The Spec Stack"</h1>
<div class="face">
<figure class="full-bleed">
<img src="assets/specification-stack.svg" />
</figure>
</div>
<aside class="notes" data-source="authored">
<p>Structured specifications emerged organically during development, forming context for the AI assistant. The first RAG version was quickly abandoned. Documentation from that experiment formed the basis for a second iteration—also abandoned but yielding important insights. The third iteration became the first usable version.</p>
</aside>
</section>
<section id="slide" class="slide slide-image" data-kind="image" data-line="9">
<div class="face">
<figure class="full-bleed">
<img src="assets/vibecoding.svg" />
</figure>
</div>
<aside class="notes" data-source="authored">
<p>Five Principles:</p>
<ol>
<li>Planning: Thorough planning remains (almost) everything.</li>
<li>Documenting: Document from user perspective, then developer perspective.</li>
<li>Testing: Use automated and manual testing regularly.</li>
<li>Pacing: If in doubt, slow down to avoid complexity.</li>
<li>Embrace failure: Vibe coding enables a "review &amp; resubmit" mentality.</li>
</ol>
</aside>
</section>
<section id="slide-2" class="slide slide-image" data-kind="image" data-line="21">
<div class="face">
<figure class="full-bleed">
<img src="assets/integrated-framework.svg" />
</figure>
</div>
<aside class="notes" data-source="authored">
<p>The integrated framework brings together structured specifications, iterative development, and continuous testing. Several themes emerge: the importance of structured context over vague prompting; the need to verify and review.</p>
</aside>
</section>"
`;

